commit be77755311d8b9d0f46f3928b1b090fd54e1e04f
Author: 100SIN <[REDACTED-EMAIL]>
Date:   Sat Jul 11 14:48:12 2026 +0900

    Harden Financial DNA share links with AES-GCM encrypted tokens
    
    - Replace plaintext ?r=<96-digit answers> exposure with opaque, versioned,
      tamper-evident ?s= tokens (AES-256-GCM, key in SHARE_SECRET env only)
    - Server-only crypto (shareToken.ts) + server action (actions.ts); token
      created server-side, decrypted server-side only; raw answers never sent
    - Store result snapshot (type, factor/axis scores, questionnaireVersion,
      scoringVersion, timestamp) so past shares survive future scoring changes
    - page.tsx decrypts ?s= first, falls back to legacy ?r= (backward compatible),
      invalid/tampered/truncated tokens safely fall back to intro
    - Web Share API on supported devices + clipboard copy with execCommand and
      manual-copy fallbacks; loading/success/error states
    - Scoring logic, 96 questions, 12 Factor, 4 axes, 16 types unchanged
    - Verified in production: 13 scenarios pass, console 0, HTTP errors 0
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

